# Wivo fake mode: `npm run dev:fake` runs the desktop app against YOUR OWN
# project of FAKE data (docs/TEST-PROJECT.md). Copy this file to
# config/test-fake.env (not tracked) and fill in the two values from
# Dashboard → Project Settings → API.
#
# Only these two, both public: the project URL and the anon (or
# sb_publishable_) key. NEVER a service_role or secret key.
#
# Refused, and the app does not start: production, the test copy (it holds
# real data) and every clinic's own project (clinics/*.json).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-fake-project-id>.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<the anon key>
